  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Survey of European market players on sea freight of flowers from Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Exploring the potential of sea freight for exporting flowers from Kenya is essential to the future sustainable growth of the flower sector in Kenya. The embassy aims to contribute to this sustainable growth. Kenya can learn from the Netherlands&#x2019; successful perishable hub creation and adopt their infrastructure best practices and business networks.By involving European importers, traders and retailers, their expertise is utilized and support to transition to sea freight is ensured. To effectively support the Kenyan segment of the flower value chains, the input of European players is highly valued by the Netherlands embassy in Nairobi.</narrative>
  </description>
